      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo! Eyi wapupaŋa akwenu, eyi kukupupa nehi; wakwatilaŋa akwenu makasu, eyi kukukwatila makasu kudi wena nehi! Chiwakale kakupupa akwenu nineyi akakupupa, chiwakakumisha kukwatila akwenu makasu, nineyi akakukwatila makasu kudi wena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, tutoŋuhu; tunakuchiŋilili; ikalaku chikasa chawu habudidi habudidi, ikalaku wamwinu wetu nawa hefuku dakumona kukala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuza yawantu yina temukine pumba damuyoyu; chiwunadi nyamuni kwiwulu ninyuza mwa-mwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu, yilobu yawu yidi nakudilila hanzi; tuŋanda twansaŋu yakumwenatudi nakutumpa nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyikwakwa yamaneni munabundidehi, akwakwenda anaketukumu dehi, yena najahi dehi chitiyaŋenu, nadiwulidehi nyikala yampwembu, habaŋaŋa muntuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituŋa hidikudishona, hidikuze-ela; Lebanoni hakutiya nsonyi, hakulepuka; Sharoni hadi neyichana chamukunkulwayi; Bashani naKarameli hiyakulukumuna mafu awu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu mudi kwakulehi tiyenu chineli; enu mudi kwakwihi ilukenu ŋovu jami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwanshidi amuZiyona anatiyi woma, kuzaala kunayikasumwishi asekesha Nzambi. Wetwinyi wakashakama hamu nakesi kanoŋeshaŋa? Wetwinyi wakashakama hamu nakesi kabidimaŋa haya nyaka?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talaku Ziyona mukala wayawija yetu yakushiika; mesu eyi akamona Yerusalema kuwushakaminu wamwena, itenti dakabula kulemunawu, hiyambakabwita yishimi yaduku, nyonji yadu hiyakaketukaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa kwenoku Yehova wakashakama nanetu chawanta, mpata yela nituloŋatwamaneni nituloŋa twanyanya; himwakenda watu weneni wakuvuwanayilapuku, hela wawanta, hiwakahitila kwoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova diyinsompeshi yetu, Yehova diyi mukwakutwinka nshimbi, Yehova diyi mwantawetu; diyi wakatwamwina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyonji yeyi yamuwatu yinasubuki; anakaŋa anyikukolesha kwishina damutondu wamuwatu, anakaŋanyi kutanjikaihina dakwendesha nachu watu; henohu dihu hadanjaŋenenuwu yuma yayivulu yapupiluwu; akwakubalakata adikwatilili yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenimbu hakahoshanindi, Ami nakataku; antu ashakamamu akayanakena kuluwakwawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
